Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 11:22:15 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 143/155] [ae-patch] Infer bracketed paste for a shell prompt
 on tmux older than 3.7

tmux 3.6 has no #{bracket_paste_flag}, so the attach seed never replayed
?2004h. A shell drew its prompt before the browser attached, the browser
xterm never learned bracketed paste was on, and the chat's Run button
refused every multi-line block. When tmux cannot report the flag, infer it:
bash, zsh or fish in the foreground on the primary screen, with the pane's
tty out of canonical mode (a line editor at its prompt). A script or the
read builtin keeps canonical mode on and gets no bracketed paste.
